<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN NANDO'S IPO 24 TIMES OVER-SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN NANDO'S IPO 24 TIMES OVER-SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African fast food group Nando's Group Holdings said on Wednesday its initial public offer (IPO) to raise 15 million rand was 24 times over-subscribed and had brought in 361 million rand.</p>
</text>
